{ id:"pos", icon:"🧩", title:"Parts of Speech", cat:"Grammar", level:"Foundation", questions:[
["In the sentence “The curious scientist carefully examined the sample”, the word “curious” is a/an ___ .",["noun","adjective","adverb","verb"],1,"“Curious” describes the noun “scientist”, and words that describe nouns are adjectives."],
["In “She speaks softly during presentations”, the word “softly” is a/an ___ .",["adjective","noun","adverb","pronoun"],2,"“Softly” tells us how she speaks, so it modifies the verb and is an adverb of manner."],
